Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.02,0:00:13.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:26.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Forgive the intrusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:28.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inside me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.37,0:00:30.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, it's cozier than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:34.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gross! I don't have any senses, but this still feels gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:36.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.51,0:00:41.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even by doing this,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.47,0:00:44.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you can't completely\Ncontrol my movements!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:48.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't intend to match strengths with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:51.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as I can dampen\Nyour motions a little bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:53.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...we can finish this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.78,0:01:01.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.07,0:01:03.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bumped my forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.16,0:01:08.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alphonse Elric,\Nyou're coming with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:10.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to see our boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.18,0:01:25.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Having you come after us would be problematic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.31,0:01:31.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll just crush\None of your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.70,0:01:43.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.62,0:01:49.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.04,0:01:56.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.71,0:02:01.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.97,0:02:06.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:12.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.11,0:04:24.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, where are the boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.24,0:04:29.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alphonse-kun was\Ntaken away by someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:33.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and Edward-kun gave chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.53,0:04:35.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While you were here,\Nand you just let them go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:38.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This had been\Ndropped in the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.34,0:04:44.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Devil's Nest?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:47.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apparently it is a bar\Noutside of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:50.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're worried about\NAlphonse-kun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.55,0:04:53.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This wasn't your doing, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:59.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it were, I wouldn't have had them kidnap him here, would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.27,0:05:06.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beyond the forest...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.65,0:05:10.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,out in the rest of the world, the fighting continues.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.91,0:05:14.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The coals of the quarrel are stoked by malice;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:17.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,sparks keep flying out,\Nand it spreads ever farther.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.41,0:05:22.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't people\Ntry to end the strife?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.63,0:05:27.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not everyone secludes themselves in the middle of a forest,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:31.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,thinking of nothing\Nbut alchemy, like you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:36.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as they continue to\Nseek the Philosopher's Stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.51,0:05:40.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,sooner or later, disaster is going to befall those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.27,0:05:43.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why won't you stop them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.52,0:05:49.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those two will come upon their answer on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.94,0:05:53.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whatever answer that answer turns out to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:05:56.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,at least it will be an answer different from your ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.24,0:06:00.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You still can't bring\Nyourself to believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.75,0:06:04.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You and I are different, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.21,0:06:07.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Both in our way of life\Nand in our alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:13.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.18,0:06:14.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.47,0:06:16.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:27.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I doubt we will ever\Nsee each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.58,0:06:45.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.71,0:06:48.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to be on the lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.96,0:06:51.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know it must be icky having me inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:52.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but try to put up with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:55.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's okay, I've gotten used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.30,0:06:57.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just don't touch my bloodseal, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:07:00.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to stay in this world if you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.27,0:07:07.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, Mister, how come\Nyou became Chimeras?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:12.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We all used to be soldiers\Na long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:15.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We were severely injured\Non the battlefield out east.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:19.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,While we were half-dead, we were taken to the military's lab facilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:21.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,where we were turned into experimental subjects.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.75,0:07:24.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The 5th Laboratory...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.50,0:07:25.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:31.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it was Greed-san who \Nbroke us out of that laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.13,0:07:33.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.67,0:07:36.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That man gave us a place where we could live.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.80,0:07:39.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:44.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See, this is a hangout where folks who,\Nfor whatever little reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:48.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,can no longer go on\Nliving out in the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.40,0:07:50.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tucker-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.69,0:07:53.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tucker-san, are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.69,0:07:55.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,D-Don't misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.07,0:07:57.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not here because I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.99,0:08:01.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The doctor here is the only one\Nwho can cure us Chimeras, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.17,0:08:11.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:14.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dr. Tucker, it's just like you said.\NHe really is hollow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.21,0:08:18.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not the one who had you kidnapped, you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:22.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.81,0:08:26.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The name's Greed. \NLet's be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.69,0:08:29.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An Uroboros tattoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:32.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.90,0:08:34.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That speeds things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.98,0:08:39.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you're friends with those \Nother people, like Envy and Lust?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.74,0:08:43.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nope. They're more like\Nmy enemies than my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:45.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:48.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al... was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:54.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How does it feel to be just\Na spirit body—someone who can't die?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.59,0:09:04.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transmuting an individual soul\Nand bonding it to some other object—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.97,0:09:10.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in other words, never getting hungry, growing tired, or growing any older.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.15,0:09:15.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what folks call\Neternal life, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.69,0:09:17.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eternal life...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:20.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You kidnapped me because that's what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.20,0:09:23.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have powerful appetites, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.62,0:09:26.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want money! I want women!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.29,0:09:27.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Status, too! Fame, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.29,0:09:33.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want all that this world has! \NAnd that goes for eternal life, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.21,0:09:35.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.75,0:09:38.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have the potential for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:40.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to\Ncooperate with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.26,0:09:44.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you refuse, I'm still going to get the secret of your soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.05,0:09:46.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,even if I have to dismantle you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.31,0:09:50.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.94,0:09:52.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really are a bad person after all, Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.15,0:09:55.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's up to you whether or not you act tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.94,0:10:00.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but there's no one who's going to rescue you from this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.44,0:10:02.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My brother was together with me back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:03.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's on his way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.91,0:10:05.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.49,0:10:07.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I beat him senseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.91,0:10:10.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You really {\i1}are{\i0} a bad person!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.71,0:10:20.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You let your guard down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:22.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of these chains with alchemy—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.17,0:10:23.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.27,0:10:33.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, relax, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.94,0:10:35.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, Martel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.02,0:10:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I forgot you were in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.99,0:10:42.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I like a guy who can\Nset his mind to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:46.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But that's not going to\Ndo you any good at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.45,0:10:47.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to defeat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.66,0:10:50.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you'll have to do\Nsomething like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.51,0:11:04.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How could you do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:06.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You guys are friends, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.20,0:11:33.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That makes me dead once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.04,0:11:38.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, can't you be a little neater when you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.75,0:11:38.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Terribly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.75,0:11:44.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even with this body,\NI'm not exactly immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:53.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.27,0:11:57.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.94,0:12:04.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pardon me for intruding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.28,0:12:05.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,S-Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.03,0:12:08.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sweetheart, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.41,0:12:13.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}A housewife!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.34,0:12:26.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold up, Edward Elric!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.72,0:12:29.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're looking for\Nyour brother, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.55,0:12:32.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have you been following me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.51,0:12:36.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just watched quietly while Al was kidnapped?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.85,0:12:40.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are pursuing them as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.90,0:12:43.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We couldn't allow your brother's safety to take top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.98,0:12:45.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.99,0:12:51.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are about to raid the Chimeras' stronghold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.03,0:12:53.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He should be there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.62,0:12:55.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tell me where this place is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.95,0:12:59.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A bar called "Devil's Nest."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.79,0:13:05.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.26,0:13:08.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't just start whaling on us\Nwithout any warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.43,0:13:11.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you the one in charge?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.59,0:13:14.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're looking after\None of mine, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.10,0:13:16.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to\Nlet me take him home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.93,0:13:18.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.77,0:13:19.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.48,0:13:27.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really... everything\Nyou do is so sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:31.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't break\Nyour fingers, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.70,0:13:34.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.29,0:13:40.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty unusual body\Nyou've got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:41.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:44.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It won't be all that easy for you to inflict even a single injury on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:46.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:49.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, I'm going to start taking this seriously, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.26,0:13:51.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei! Is Brother around?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:53.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what I'd like to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.43,0:13:56.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, you two can't even \Nrun a decent errand for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.64,0:14:00.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brace yourself, because afterward, \Nyou're going to get a proper scolding!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:03.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.69,0:14:10.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No transmutation circle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.99,0:14:16.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not going to dodge me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:18.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not given to raising\Nmy hand against women.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.70,0:14:19.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:22.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,want to learn the secret of his transmutation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:24.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And when you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.75,0:14:29.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gain eternal life, \Nand then everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.55,0:14:31.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This isn't going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.34,0:14:36.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.18,0:14:43.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.35,0:14:46.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it won't be all that easy for you to inflict even a single injury on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.04,0:15:03.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dear...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.62,0:15:06.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've had enough\Nof just looking on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.17,0:15:10.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.51,0:15:13.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,about to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.09,0:15:18.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,lose one of my children...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.89,0:15:22.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.43,0:15:24.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:28.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, my, are you still planning to go at it some more?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.08,0:15:47.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.63,0:15:51.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:52.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.05,0:15:58.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've overdone it there, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.01,0:16:02.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, you're going to cease your futile resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.35,0:16:06.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna have to do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.10,0:16:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but if you resist,\Nyou know what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.65,0:16:12.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You get your filthy hands off of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:20.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the double! Fifth and Seventh Squads,\Ncover the rear entrance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.49,0:16:22.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Third and Ninth Squads,\Nseal off the area around the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.95,0:16:24.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The rest of you, take the front!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.96,0:16:28.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now we've got the older brother, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.87,0:16:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got our whole cast together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.80,0:16:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tucker?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.71,0:16:36.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.72,0:16:37.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.68,0:16:39.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.18,0:16:42.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not only have you kidnapped Al,\Nbut you've gone and hurt Sensei, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.01,0:16:47.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey now, if you would just tell me how to bond a spirit, I'll just—
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.52,0:16:48.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.48,0:16:50.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're going to return both Al and Sensei to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:52.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:53.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That man is a homunculus!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:55.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:57.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, I've got a hostage right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:57.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No wonder!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.66,0:17:03.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, would all of you \Njust listen to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.12,0:17:07.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.58,0:17:09.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed!\NRight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:18.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.38,0:17:22.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the Mightiest Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.01,0:17:26.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.93,0:17:27.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.86,0:17:38.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.57,0:17:41.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a one-on-one fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.86,0:17:44.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care of Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.91,0:17:45.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:49.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you want to defeat me,\Nthen fight with\Nthe intent to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.29,0:17:51.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.12,0:17:55.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to send you flying, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:17:59.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready to storm in\Nthrough the back door.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.55,0:18:00.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The alley has been sealed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.26,0:18:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ready to charge in!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.28,0:18:23.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That won't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:27.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.70,0:18:30.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had no idea you guys were this hard to get through to!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.41,0:18:31.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.58,0:18:35.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You even committed a taboo\Nin order to obtain what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.21,0:18:37.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As someone so loyal\Nto their desires,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.71,0:18:40.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't think it would be so hard for you to understand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:43.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you lump me in with the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:44.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.59,0:18:48.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whether we're homunculus or human, it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:52.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We live only to be devoted to our desires, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.89,0:18:53.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.81,0:18:57.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know about how you are now\Nlooking for the Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.73,0:19:00.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't care about\Nthe Philosopher's Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:05.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just want to return Al—\Nmy brother—to his original form!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.70,0:19:08.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He'd be better off\Nstaying the way he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.78,0:19:10.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.49,0:19:12.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you presume to decide that for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.37,0:19:16.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have no intention of negotiating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.38,0:19:22.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you homunculi are born of \Nthe errors made by us alchemists,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.96,0:19:27.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then we alchemists will just\Nhave to correct those errors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.14,0:19:31.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that a fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.93,0:19:35.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This kind of turns me into an ugly man,\Nso I was hoping not to have to show it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.89,0:19:38.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But out of consideration\Nfor your resolve,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.31,0:19:41.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take you on seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.73,0:19:44.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.99,0:19:47.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my serious mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.91,0:19:48.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.84,0:20:05.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Barely felt that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.47,0:20:06.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.13,0:20:10.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The composition and structural material of my body is as normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:13.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Mightiest Shield, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.47,0:20:16.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've never killed\Nsomeone before, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.19,0:20:18.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.98,0:20:21.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm saying you don't have the heart to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.19,0:20:24.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to\Ndefeat me like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.07,0:20:28.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And that goes for\Nthe other homunculi too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.11,0:20:32.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let me give you enough heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:38.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.30,0:20:44.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.71,0:20:45.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.92,0:20:46.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bad news! The military—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.09,0:20:52.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.68,0:20:56.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now of all times...\NThe big show is going to be ruined.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:20:59.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this really the time\Nto be acting so casual?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.52,0:21:03.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.36,0:21:06.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no one in the military who can do anything to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.20,0:21:14.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kimbly...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.25,0:21:23.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you! You betrayed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.55,0:21:29.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.76,0:21:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, we're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.38,0:21:32.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.05,0:21:34.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Catch you later, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.10,0:21:37.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.81,0:21:40.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.89,0:21:42.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please do not resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.69,0:21:44.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Resist? What are you talking—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.23,0:21:46.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Col. Archer is calling for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.11,0:21:47.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:49.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're about to take my brother away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.74,0:21:50.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't just sit back and—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.95,0:21:54.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.97,0:23:40.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.60,0:23:43.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 34: "Theory of Greed"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.43,0:23:46.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.64,0:23:49.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Greed, I {\i1}will{\i0} defeat you!
